{"id":148851,"accession_number":"1976.90","share_license_status":"CC0","tombstone":"Peonies (牡丹), late 1200s. China, Yuan dynasty (1271-1368). Hanging scroll; ink and color on silk; painting: 145.5 x 88.3 cm (57 5/16 x 34 3/4 in.); overall with knobs: 256 x 113.2 cm (100 13/16 x 44 9/16 in.). The Cleveland Museum of Art, John L. Severance Fund, 1976.90","current_location":null,"title":"Peonies","title_in_original_language":"牡丹","creation_date":"late 1200s","creation_date_earliest":1275,"creation_date_latest":1299,"artists_tags":[],"culture":["China, Yuan dynasty (1271-1368)"],"technique":"hanging scroll; ink and color on silk","support_materials":[],"department":"Chinese Art","collection":"ASIAN - Hanging scroll","type":"Painting","measurements":"Painting: 145.5 x 88.3 cm (57 5/16 x 34 3/4 in.); Overall with knobs: 256 x 113.2 cm (100 13/16 x 44 9/16 in.)","dimensions":{"painting":{"height":1.455,"height_inch":57,"height_inch_fraction":0.3125,"width":0.883,"width_inch":34,"width_inch_fraction":0.75},"overall":{"height":2.56,"height_inch":100,"height_inch_fraction":0.8125,"width":1.057,"width_inch":41,"width_inch_fraction":0.625},"overall with knobs":{"height":2.56,"height_inch":100,"height_inch_fraction":0.8125,"width":1.132,"width_inch":44,"width_inch_fraction":0.5625}},"state_of_the_work":null,"edition_of_the_work":null,"copyright":null,"inscriptions":[],"exhibitions":{"current":[{"id":302374,"title":"Year in Review, 1976","description":"<i>Year in Review, 1976</i>. The Cleveland Museum of Art, Cleveland, OH (organizer) (February 1-March 6, 1977).","opening_date":"1977-02-01T05:00:00"},{"id":304517,"title":"Eight Dynasties of Chinese Painting","description":"<i>Eight Dynasties of Chinese Painting</i>. The Nelson-Atkins Museum of Art (November 7, 1980-January 4, 1981); The Cleveland Museum of Art (February 11-March 29, 1981); Tokyo National Museum (October 4-November 17, 1982).","opening_date":"1981-02-11T05:00:00"},{"id":293212,"title":"Greeting the Spring (Chines